ing worked properly you  should see the original text a sentiment  score and a magnitude in the terminal if  not take a look back at the code for any  syntax errors congratulations you've  just sent your first request to the  natural language API but there is more  that the cloud natural language API can  do like analyzing syntax and annotating  text to find out more about the client  libraries consult natural language  basics or a work through the sentiment  analysis tutorial check out the cloud  documentation  you

